{"pageProps":{"page":{"ID":1367,"post_author":"3","post_date":"November 26, 2024","post_date_gmt":"2024-11-26 15:17:10","post_title":"Citi invests in Pylon, the autonomous mortgage infrastructure platform","post_status":"publish","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","post_name":"citi-invests-in-pylon-the-programmatic-mortgage-infrastructure-platform","post_modified":"2026-03-19 18:55:02","post_modified_gmt":"2026-03-19 18:55:02","guid":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/?p=1367","post_type":"post","filter":"raw","url":"https://pylon-two.vercel.app/resources/citi-invests-in-pylon-the-programmatic-mortgage-infrastructure-platform/","preview_type":"image","content_blocks":[{"acf_fc_layout":"asset_block","asset":{"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image"}]}},{"acf_fc_layout":"text_block","text":"<p><a href=\"https://www.citigroup.com/global/news/press-release/2024/citi-invests-in-pylon-the-programmatic-mortgage-infrastructure-platform\">https://www.citigroup.com/global/news/press-release/2024/citi-invests-in-pylon-the-programmatic-mortgage-infrastructure-platform</a></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">NEW YORK – Citi has made a minority strategic investment in Pylon, a mortgage infrastructure provider.</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">The investment was made jointly through Citi’s Spread Products Investment Technologies (SPRINT) unit and Citi Ventures. Citi is joining existing investors Conversion Capital, Allegis Capital, Peter Thiel, QED, and Fifth Wall.</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">In addition to the investment, Citi and Pylon are working together to integrate the industry-leading liquidity offered by Citi’s mortgage trading desk directly into the Pylon platform. This will effectively provide Pylon customers with direct access to Citi’s institutional-grade products and rates.</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Founded in 2022, Pylon’s mission is to rewire mortgage from the ground up. The Pylon platform delivers programmatic originations and capital through its enterprise-grade APIs. The company serves innovative businesses across wealth management, homebuilding, servicers, banks, and select lenders.</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">“We’re pleased to have the secured this investment from Citi, which marks a significant milestone for Pylon,” said Trent Hedge, Founder and CEO of Pylon. “Our connectivity with Citi’s mortgage trading desk delivers the same unobstructed access to Wall Street that was previously only available to the largest market participants.”</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">&#8220;Pylon&#8217;s next-generation, multi-product platform is built on an intelligent core. We&#8217;re excited to launch this strategic initiative and deliver the scale of our industry-leading Spread Products business to Pylon,&#8221; said Patrick Brett, Head of Citi SPRINT Investments.</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Citi SPRINT makes strategic equity investments in start-ups in the specialty lending, alternative investment and real estate spaces.</span></p>\n"}],"related_heading":"Keep reading","related_button_label":"Read more","categories":[{"id":15,"name":"News","slug":"news"}],"author":{"name":"Trent Hedge","acf":{"profile_image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/image-2.png","alt":"image 2","width":800,"height":800}}},"seo":{"title":"Citi invests in Pylon, the autonomous mortgage infrastructure platform - Pylon","description":"Citi made a strategic investment in Pylon through SPRINT and Citi Ventures, integrating Citi's mortgage trading desk directly into Pylon's API-first platform.","image":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Citi-_-Pylon.png"},"featured_image":{"src":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Citi-_-Pylon.png","width":760,"height":460,"alt":"Citi Pylon"}},"options":{"menu":{"nav_items":[{"link":{"title":"Platform","url":"/#","target":""},"has_submenu":true,"submenu_type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"grid","grid_links":[{"r